msgid "Franck-Condon calculations"
msgstr "弗兰克-康登计算"

msgid "FRANCK-CONDON FACTORS (FCON)"
msgstr "弗兰克-康登因子 (FCON)"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "The following *options* are available:"
msgstr "以下\\ *选项*\\ 可用："

msgid ""
"Some of the keywords as described for the ``VCI`` program are also valid for"
" the ``FCON`` program, i.e. ``CITYPE, LEVEX, CIMAX, NDIM, NBAS, BASIS`` and "
"``INFO``."
msgstr ""
"``VCI`` 程序中描述的一些关键字对 ``FCON`` 程序也有效，即 ``CITYPE, LEVEX, CIMAX, NDIM, NBAS, "
"BASIS`` 和 ``INFO``\\ 。"

msgid "Information Handling"
msgstr "信息处理"

msgid "Example 1"
msgstr "示例 1"

msgid ""
"The following example shows the input for a calculation of Franck-Condon "
"factors at the VCI level. The selection of important Franck-Condon factors "
"will be done at the VSCF level without Duschinsky rotation."
msgstr "以下示例展示了在VCI级别计算弗兰克-康登因子的输入。重要的弗兰克-康登因子选择将在VSCF级别完成，且不包含杜辛斯基旋转。"

msgid "Example 2"
msgstr "示例 2"

msgid ""
"This alternative example shows the use of the ``AUTO`` cards, which may be "
"used to control the correct order of the records. It avoids the explicit use"
" of record numbers."
msgstr "这个替代示例展示了 ``AUTO`` 卡片的使用，它可用于控制记录的正确顺序，从而避免显式使用记录编号。"

msgid "ELECTRONIC-VIBRATIONAL SPECTRA (EVSPEC)"
msgstr "电子-振动光谱 (EVSPEC)"

msgid "The keyword ``INFO`` has the same meaning as in the other programs."
msgstr "关键字 ``INFO`` 的含义与其他程序中的相同。"

msgid "Handling of Initial States"
msgstr "初始态的处理"

msgid "RWF calculations"
msgstr "RWF计算"

msgid "CIKS calculations"
msgstr "CIKS 计算"

msgid "Vibrational configuration basis"
msgstr "振动组态基"

msgid ""
"The keywords ``CITYPE``, ``LEVEX``, and ``CIMAX`` restrict the VCI basis to "
"certain excitation patterns, and have the same meaning as in the other "
"modules:"
msgstr "关键词 ``CITYPE``\\ 、\\ ``LEVEX`` 和 ``CIMAX`` 将VCI基限制在特定的激发模式，其含义与其他模块中的相同："

msgid "Vibrational interaction matrix"
msgstr "振动相互作用矩阵"

msgid "Interface to Gnuplot"
msgstr "Gnuplot 接口"

msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"The following example shows a general program flow involving the ``EVSPEC`` "
"calculations."
msgstr "以下示例展示了涉及 ``EVSPEC`` 计算的一般程序流程。"
